cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use EconSim in your work, please cite it as below. EconSim is a simulation, not a forecast."
title: "EconSim"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Wittmann"
    given-names: "Tyson"
version: "2026.10.23.2"
date-released: "2026-10-23"
repository-code: "https://github.com/twitt212/econsim"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  EconSim is an agent-based macroeconomic simulator of a US-like economy, written in Rust. Each question is run twice
  from the same starting state with the same random numbers, with and without the change, so the difference between the
  two runs isolates the effect of the change. It is a simulation, not a forecast.
keywords:
  - agent-based model
  - macroeconomics
  - simulation
  - monetary policy
  - Rust
